    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Jobs and tasks",
     "texto": [
      "**iş** = job; **meslek** = profession; **ofis** = office.",
      "**çalışmak** can mean work or study, depending on the context.",
      "The habitual present describes tasks: **doktor hastaları muayene eder** = the doctor examines the patients."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
